Subtask 3.3: Setting Up Monitoring Alerts
Configure Host Monitoring
Navigate to Administration → Configure:

Engine → Notifications
Enable email notifications for host events
Configure SMTP settings
Create Custom Monitoring Scripts
#!/bin/bash
# Host monitoring script example
# Save as /usr/local/bin/rhvm-host-monitor.sh

RHVM_API="https://your-rhvm-manager/ovirt-engine/api"
USERNAME="admin@internal"
PASSWORD="your-password"

# Get host status
curl -k -u "$USERNAME:$PASSWORD" \
  -H "Accept: application/xml" \
  "$RHVM_API/hosts" | \
  grep -E "(name|status)"
Schedule Monitoring Tasks
# Add to crontab for regular monitoring
crontab -e

# Add line for every 5 minutes monitoring
*/5 * * * * /usr/local/bin/rhvm-host-monitor.sh >> /var/log/rhvm-monitoring.log
